{"pin":"AB10492","subcodes":[{"code":"AB10492","anchor":"","first_line":"O Thou kind Lord! Bestow heavenly confirmation upon this daughter of the Kingdom and graciously aid her","first_line_orig":"ای خداوند مهربان این دختر ملکوت را تایید فرما و توفیق بخش تا بر امرت ثابت  ","language":"Per","word_count":"60","full_text_parts":["O Thou kind lord!\nBestow heavenly confirmation upon this daughter of the Kingdom and graciously aid her that she may remain firm and steadfast in Thy Cause and that she may, even as a nightingale of the rose-garden of mysteries, warble melodies in the Abhá Kingdom in most wondrous tones, thereby bringing happiness to everyone. Make her exalted among the daughters of the Kingdom and enable her to attain life eternal.\nThou art the Bestower, the All-Loving."],"translations":[{"language":"ml","lang_name":"Malayalam"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"fi","lang_name":"Finnish"},{"language":"iba","lang_name":"Iban"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"mn","lang_name":"Mongolian"},{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"hr","lang_name":"Croatian"},{"language":"ta","lang_name":"Tamil"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"el","lang_name":"Greek"},{"language":"is","lang_name":"Icelandic"},{"language":"ht","lang_name":"Haitian Creole"},{"language":"sm","lang_name":"Samoan"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"language":"az","lang_name":"Azerbaijani"},{"language":"sk","lang_name":"Slovak"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"}],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"E. Mahony","source":"E","locator":"Mahony","url":"https://music.elikamahony.com/album/daughter-of-the-kingdom"},{"kind":"music","code":"Martha \u0026 Mahdis","source":"Martha \u0026 Mahdis","url":"https://youtu.be/O2HuNGhdT_s"},{"kind":"music","code":"S. Toloui-Wallace","source":"S","locator":"Toloui-W